# The build only needs the sources: keep local artefacts, history and secrets
# out of the context sent to the daemon. A bare pattern matches at the root of
# the context only; **/ extends it to every folder, src/ included, where an
# in-tree build leaves its objects, moc files and Makefile.
.git
.github
**/*.o
**/*.moc
**/moc_*
**/qrc_*
**/ui_*
**/Makefile
build*/
release/
debug/
**/*.user
**/*.AppImage
**/*.dmg
**/*.exe
**/ngPost
**/ngPost.conf
**/ngPost.log
tests/
doc/
# Not needed inside the image, and editing them would invalidate the cache of
# every layer that follows the source copy.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
